WEBVTT

00:00:00.231 --> 00:00:02.846
Any job posting. One click.

00:00:03.154 --> 00:00:06.846
It reads the page first — title, salary, location, remote

00:00:07.231 --> 00:00:10.231
The job lands in JobHunt straight away

00:00:10.538 --> 00:00:12.769
about a minute later…

00:00:13.077 --> 00:00:15.308
Everything filled in: company, remote status, salary band

00:00:15.692 --> 00:00:20.923
And scored against your resume, requirement by requirement

00:00:21.385 --> 00:00:27.692
Sort by fit — your whole list ranks itself
